query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% NY N286927 (March 2018): Artificial Snowflakes with Glitter.
% CBP: the artificial snowflakes with glitter -> 3901.20
scenario ny_n286927 is, as stated in ruling NY N286927:
    % the specific gravity is the one the ruling gives for high-density
    % polyethylene, of which the item predominantly consists (0.94 to 0.965)
    the kind of the artificial snowflakes with glitter is flakes,
        confer "This product consists of raw flakes of high-density polyethylene (HDPE)".
    the polymer of the artificial snowflakes with glitter is polyethylene,
        confer "this item is predominantly composed of high density polyethylene".
    the artificial snowflakes with glitter contains 80 percent of polyethylene,
        confer "The blend is 80 percent HDPE and 20 percent PET".
    the artificial snowflakes with glitter contains 20 percent of polyethylene terephthalate,
        confer "The blend is 80 percent HDPE and 20 percent PET".
    the specific gravity of the artificial snowflakes with glitter is 0.94,
        confer "High-density polyethylene is characterized by a specific gravity within the range of 0.94 and 0.965".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the artificial snowflakes with glitter is 3901.20"].

