    the polymer of redispersible powder CBP46 is vinyl acetate copolymer,
        confer "It is a copolymer composed of 77.4 percent vinyl acetate, 5.6 percent ethylene".
    redispersible powder CBP46 is mixed with other substances,
        confer "17 percent calcium carbonate filler".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of redispersible powder CBP46 is 3905.29"].

