% NY N351337 (July 2025): air hose reels from Cambodia.
% CBP: the retractable air hose reel (SKU 821-1360) -> 3917.39
scenario ny_n351337 is, as stated in ruling NY N351337:
    the retractable air hose reel is a manufactured article,
        confer "is a 50-foot single arm retractable air hose reel".
    the retractable air hose reel is a composite good,
        confer "It consists of a ½ inch by 50-foot air hose and a reel".
    the air hose of the retractable air hose reel is a component of the retractable air hose reel,
        confer "It consists of a ½ inch by 50-foot air hose and a reel".
    the steel reel of the retractable air hose reel is a component of the retractable air hose reel,
        confer "The reel is made of steel and includes a spring-loaded auto-rewind reel mechanism".
    the kind of the air hose of the retractable air hose reel is hose,
        confer "It consists of a ½ inch by 50-foot air hose".
    the polymer of the air hose of the retractable air hose reel is polyvinyl chloride,
        confer "the hose is constructed predominantly of polyvinyl chloride (PVC) plastic reinforced with braided polyester".
    the air hose of the retractable air hose reel is combined with materials other than plastics,
        confer "polyvinyl chloride (PVC) plastic reinforced with braided polyester".
    the air hose of the retractable air hose reel has fittings,
        confer "features male brass fittings at both ends".
    the essential character of the retractable air hose reel is given by the air hose of the retractable air hose reel,
        according to CBP, confer "the essential character of the air hose reels at issue is imparted by the hoses".
    the principal use of the retractable air hose reel is delivering pressurized air to pneumatic tools,
        according to CBP, confer "The hoses serve to deliver pressurized air from an air compressor to pneumatic hand tools".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the retractable air hose reel is 3917.39"].

