% NY N342618 (December 2024): an acrylic roller shade from Vietnam.
% CBP: the blackout polyester fabric roller shade -> 3925.30
scenario ny_n342618 is, as stated in ruling NY N342618:
    the blackout polyester fabric roller shade is a manufactured article,
        confer "The product under consideration is referred to as a “blackout polyester fabric roller shade.”".
    the kind of the blackout polyester fabric roller shade is shade,
        confer "The product under consideration is referred to as a “blackout polyester fabric roller shade.”".
    the blackout polyester fabric roller shade is of cellular plastics reinforced by a textile fabric,
        according to CBP, confer "the shade is made of a plain woven, uniformly dyed, textile fabric coated with cellular plastic and the fabric is considered to be present merely for reinforcing purposes".
    the blackout polyester fabric roller shade is claimed to belong to textile blinds of heading 6303,
        confer "In your ruling request, you suggested the shade is classified under subheading 6303.92.2030, HTSUS".
    the claim that the blackout polyester fabric roller shade belongs to textile blinds of heading 6303 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "As the fabric is found to be of plastic rather than textile, the shade is excluded from Chapter 63".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the blackout polyester fabric roller shade is 3925.30"].

