    the fabric construction of style AC3717 is knitted,
        confer "constructed from weft knit pile".
    style AC3717 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "an inner layer of 100% polyester".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style AC3717 is 6101.30"].

