% NY N337233 (January 2024): a women's blouse and shrug from China.
% CBP: the blouse of style HLW75553 -> 6106.90; the shrug of style HLW75553 -> 6114.90
scenario ny_n337233 is, as stated in ruling NY N337233:
    % the 2-in-1 set is classified garment by garment
    the blouse of style HLW75553 is an upper body garment,
        confer "The loose-fitting, sleeveless blouse extends from the neck to below the waist".
    the blouse of style HLW75553 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the cut of the blouse of style HLW75553 indicates women,
        confer "Style HLW75553 is a women’s 2 -in-1 knit blouse and shrug set".
    the fabric construction of the blouse of style HLW75553 is knitted,
        confer "constructed from 70 percent wool and 30 percent silk knit fabric".
    the blouse of style HLW75553 contains 70 percent of wool,
        confer "constructed from 70 percent wool and 30 percent silk knit fabric".
    the blouse of style HLW75553 contains 30 percent of silk,
        confer "constructed from 70 percent wool and 30 percent silk knit fabric".
    the blouse of style HLW75553 is loose-fitting,
        confer "The loose-fitting, sleeveless blouse extends from the neck to below the waist".
    the blouse of style HLW75553 is sleeveless,
        confer "The loose-fitting, sleeveless blouse extends from the neck to below the waist".
    the kind of the shrug of style HLW75553 is shrug,
        confer "The shrug to style HLW75553 fits over the head and features a crew neck, no front or back coverage, and long sleeves".
    the cut of the shrug of style HLW75553 indicates women,
        confer "Style HLW75553 is a women’s 2 -in-1 knit blouse and shrug set".
    the fabric construction of the shrug of style HLW75553 is knitted,
        confer "knit blouse and shrug set constructed from 70 percent wool and 30 percent silk knit fabric".
    the shrug of style HLW75553 contains 70 percent of wool,
        confer "knit blouse and shrug set constructed from 70 percent wool and 30 percent silk knit fabric".
    the shrug of style HLW75553 contains 30 percent of silk,
        confer "knit blouse and shrug set constructed from 70 percent wool and 30 percent silk knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the shrug of style HLW75553 is 6114.90", "the subheading of the blouse of style HLW75553 is 6106.90"].

