% NY N285198 (May 2017): a man's swimsuit from China.
% CBP: style 570001 -> 6112.31
scenario ny_n285198 is, as stated in ruling NY N285198:
    the kind of style 570001 is swimsuit,
        confer "is a man’s swimsuit bottom".
    the cut of style 570001 indicates men,
        confer "is a man’s swimsuit bottom".
    the fabric construction of style 570001 is knitted,
        confer "upon examination it was determined that the fabric is actually of knit construction".
    style 570001 contains 67 percent of nylon,
        confer "the swimsuit is constructed of 67% nylon, 33% polyurethane woven fabric".
    % VOCAB: 33% polyurethane (as a fibre of the fabric), no listed material
    style 570001 is claimed to belong to garments of heading 6210,
        confer "you suggested classification under subheading 6210.40.5550".
    the claim that style 570001 belongs to garments of heading 6210 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "We have examined the garment and it is not considered coated for tariff purposes".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 570001 is 6112.31"].

% NY N351400 (July 2025): a weighted vest from China.
% CBP: the Harkla weighted compression vest -> 6113.00
scenario ny_n351400 is, as stated in ruling NY N351400:
    the Harkla weighted compression vest is an upper body garment,
        confer "The garment extends from the shoulders to the hip area".
    the Harkla weighted compression vest is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the Harkla weighted compression vest is sleeveless,
        confer "oversized armed openings secured with hook-and loop fasteners".
    the Harkla weighted compression vest is made up of fabric of heading 5906,
        confer "bonded together with a rubber application in between. The rubber application is visible to the naked eye".
    the Harkla weighted compression vest is a composite good,
        confer "As the Harkla’s Weighted Vest is a composite good".
    the polyester vest of the Harkla weighted compression vest is a component of the Harkla weighted compression vest,
        confer "the polyester vest is the component and not the pellets in the vest".
    the fabric construction of the polyester vest of the Harkla weighted compression vest is knitted,
        confer "is composed of an outer and inner 100% polyester flat knit fabric".
    the polyester vest of the Harkla weighted compression vest contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "is composed of an outer and inner 100% polyester flat knit fabric".
    the weights of the Harkla weighted compression vest is a component of the Harkla weighted compression vest,
        confer "interior pockets at the bottom front and back that can hold removable weights".
    the essential character of the Harkla weighted compression vest is given by the polyester vest of the Harkla weighted compression vest,
        according to CBP, confer "This office finds that the polyester vest is the component and not the pellets in the vest that imparts the essential character of the garment".
    the Harkla weighted compression vest is claimed to belong to articles for handicapped persons of heading 9817,
        confer "You propose a secondary classification under subheading 9817.00.96".
    the claim that the Harkla weighted compression vest belongs to articles for handicapped persons of heading 9817 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "Weighted Vest will not be classified in subheading 9817.00.96".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Harkla weighted compression vest is 6113.00"].

