scenario ny_n304667 is, as stated in ruling NY N304667:
    % DISAGREES (sample 1): CBP gives 6206.30 (blouse); the model gives
    % 6211.42 — the ruling records neither a loose fit nor an opening at the
    % neckline (Chapter 62 note 4).
    sample 1 is an upper body garment,
        confer "Sample 1 is a woman’s blouse constructed from 100% cotton woven fabric".
    sample 1 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the cut of sample 1 indicates women,
        confer "Sample 1 is a woman’s blouse".
    the fabric construction of sample 1 is woven,
        confer "Sample 1 is a woman’s blouse constructed from 100% cotton woven fabric".
    sample 1 contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "Sample 1 is a woman’s blouse constructed from 100% cotton woven fabric".
    sample 1 has a collar,
        confer "The pullover style blouse features a stand up collar".
    the kind of sample 2 is trousers,
        confer "Sample 2 is a pair of women’s trousers".
    the cut of sample 2 indicates women,
        confer "Sample 2 is a pair of women’s trousers".
    the fabric construction of sample 2 is woven,
        confer "Sample 2 is a pair of women’s trousers constructed from 100% cotton woven fabric".
    sample 2 contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "Sample 2 is a pair of women’s trousers constructed from 100% cotton woven fabric".
    the kind of sample 3 is shawl,
        confer "Sample 3 is a woven shawl composed of 100% cotton fabric".
    the fabric construction of sample 3 is woven,
        confer "Sample 3 is a woven shawl composed of 100% cotton fabric".
    sample 3 contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "Sample 3 is a woven shawl composed of 100% cotton fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of sample 2 is 6204.62", "the subheading of sample 1 is 6211.42", "the subheading of sample 3 is 6214.90"].

% NY N359019 (March 2026): a unisex fishing vest from Vietnam.
% CBP: style 81950 -> 6210.50
scenario ny_n359019 is, as stated in ruling NY N359019:
    % DISAGREES: CBP gives 6210.50; the model gives 6211.43 — the coated
    % fabric (heading 5903) is recorded on the vest's nylon panels, not on
    % the vest, and heading 6210 reads the garment's fabric.
    the essential character of style 81950 is given by no single component,
        according to CBP, confer "No one component imparts the essential character for the garment".
    % Unisex: no gender fact. A composite good of coated woven nylon panels and
    % polyester mesh knit; CBP finds that no component gives the essential character
    % and applies GRI 3(c).
    style 81950 is an upper body garment,
        confer "Style 81950, Dry Line Vest, is a unisex fishing vest".
    style 81950 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    style 81950 is sleeveless,
        confer "is a unisex fishing vest".
    style 81950 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "The garment features a full-frontal opening secured with an adjustable buckle closure".
    style 81950 is a composite good,
        confer "No one component imparts the essential character for the garment".
    the coated nylon panels of style 81950 is a component of style 81950,
        confer "The front panels, back yolk and lumbar are composed of 100% nylon woven fabric, with a visible polyurethane coating on the inner surface".
    the fabric construction of the coated nylon panels of style 81950 is woven,
        confer "are composed of 100% nylon woven fabric".
    the coated nylon panels of style 81950 contains 100 percent of nylon,
        confer "are composed of 100% nylon woven fabric".
    the coated nylon panels of style 81950 is made up of fabric of heading 5903,
        confer "with a visible polyurethane coating on the inner surface".
    the polyester mesh of style 81950 is a component of style 81950,
        confer "The remainder of the garment is composed of 100% polyester mesh knit fabric".
    the fabric construction of the polyester mesh of style 81950 is knitted,
        confer "The remainder of the garment is composed of 100% polyester mesh knit fabric".
    the polyester mesh of style 81950 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The remainder of the garment is composed of 100% polyester mesh knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 81950 is 6211.43"].

% NY N353611 (October 2025): 3-piece tie sets from Vietnam.
% CBP: item 2 -> 6215.20; item 3 -> 6215.20
scenario ny_n353611 is, as stated in ruling NY N353611:
    % item 2 and item 3 are Item #2 and Item #3 of the ruling.
    % VOCAB: faux pocket square (made up clothing accessory on cardstock), no listed kind.
    % VOCAB: tie bar and cufflinks (imitation jewelry of base metal), no listed kind or material.
    item 2 is a set put up for retail sale,
        confer "Thus, they meet the requirements for classification as a set".
    the necktie of item 2 is a component of item 2,
        confer "Item #2 consists of a necktie, faux pocket square and a metal tie bar".
    the kind of the necktie of item 2 is tie,
        confer "Item #2 consists of a necktie".
    the fabric construction of the necktie of item 2 is woven,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the necktie of item 2 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the pocket square of item 2 is a component of item 2,
        confer "Item #2 consists of a necktie, faux pocket square and a metal tie bar".
    the fabric construction of the pocket square of item 2 is woven,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the pocket square of item 2 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the tie bar of item 2 is a component of item 2,
        confer "The metal tie bar is composed of copper and carbon fiber".
    the essential character of item 2 is given by the necktie of item 2,
        according to CBP, confer "it is the necktie which, by its bulk, quantity, weight, value, and role provides the essential character".
    item 3 is a set put up for retail sale,
        confer "Thus, they meet the requirements for classification as a set".
    the necktie of item 3 is a component of item 3,
        confer "Item #3 consists of a necktie, faux pocket square and a pair of cufflinks".
    the kind of the necktie of item 3 is tie,
        confer "Item #3 consists of a necktie".
    the fabric construction of the necktie of item 3 is woven,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the necktie of item 3 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the pocket square of item 3 is a component of item 3,
        confer "Item #3 consists of a necktie, faux pocket square and a pair of cufflinks".
    the fabric construction of the pocket square of item 3 is woven,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the pocket square of item 3 contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "The necktie and faux pocket square are constructed from 100% polyester woven fabric".
    the cufflinks of item 3 is a component of item 3,
        confer "The cufflinks are composed of iron and glass".
    the essential character of item 3 is given by the necktie of item 3,
        according to CBP, confer "it is the necktie which, by its bulk, quantity, weight, value, and role provides the essential character".

    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of item 2 is 6215.20", "the subheading of item 3 is 6215.20"].